-It counts,
but it renders you wordless.

00:20:20.919 --> 00:20:23.121
-Did she say hello to you?

00:20:23.121 --> 00:20:25.290
-Yes.
-You met her!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:29.061
-Yeah.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:20:29.061 --> 00:20:30.895
