that wasn't there, but...

00:24:12.550 --> 00:24:14.085
And then I shut that down.

00:24:14.085 --> 00:24:15.519
I shut that down
like a human being.

00:24:15.519 --> 00:24:17.856
But there was that
split second of "Burn her."

00:24:17.856 --> 00:24:21.426
[ Laughter ]

00:24:21.426 --> 00:24:24.495
-I also feel this --
I've always felt this way --

00:24:24.495 --> 00:24:26.331
-I hope you're fine.
-Yeah, yeah, of course.

00:24:26.331 --> 00:24:27.632
-I hope --
-That goes without saying.

00:24:27.632 --> 00:24:30.034
-I realize --
in self-quarantine,

00:24:30.034 --> 00:24:32.437
and we shouldn't burn her.
-Yeah.

00:24:32.437 --> 00:24:33.705
We actually do --

00:24:33.705 --> 00:24:36.441
Our ratings are almost best --

00:24:36.441 --> 00:24:38.176
The demographic
we do the best with

00:24:38.176 --> 00:24:39.444
are people who are
self-isolating.

00:24:39.444 --> 00:24:41.947
-That's right. That's right.
Emotional shut-ins.

00:24:41.947 --> 00:24:43.081
That's why I like this show.

00:24:43.081 --> 00:24:44.416
-[ Laughs ]

00:24:44.416 --> 00:24:47.885
You know that thing
where whenever someone

00:24:47.885 --> 00:24:49.120
