hosts that we're giving you

00:25:47.979 --> 00:25:49.881
these sweet --
these sweet, sweet tips."

00:25:49.881 --> 00:25:51.483
-I just don't know
how I'd react

00:25:51.483 --> 00:25:53.150
if if a stranger came up
and said,

00:25:53.150 --> 00:25:55.687
"Do you want a stock tip?"
No!

00:25:55.687 --> 00:25:57.255
Leave -- No.

00:25:57.255 --> 00:25:59.924
And if a friend told me,
"Would you like a stock tip?"

00:25:59.924 --> 00:26:02.760
I'd say, "We're finished."
-Yeah.

00:26:02.760 --> 00:26:03.761
-A stock tip.

00:26:03.761 --> 00:26:07.031
-I give people John tips
where I go.

00:26:07.031 --> 00:26:08.833
"Don't tell him about stocks."

00:26:08.833 --> 00:26:10.135
-He doesn't want
to hear about it.

00:26:10.135 --> 00:26:13.138 line:0%
-Welcome back.
-It's very nice to be back.

00:26:13.138 --> 00:26:15.640 line:0%
-It's been a while.
It's been a while in the studio.

00:26:15.640 --> 00:26:17.208 line:0%
We've talked via Zoom
a few times.

00:26:17.208 --> 00:26:20.644 line:0%
-Yes. It's been almost
exactly two years

00:26:20.644 --> 00:26:22.346 line:0%
since I've been in this studio.

00:26:22.346 --> 00:26:24.748 line:0%
