00:27:35.687 --> 00:27:37.689
-I think it's very wise
for both of us

00:27:37.689 --> 00:27:38.756
to get well out of
the prediction game.

00:27:38.756 --> 00:27:41.025
-Yes. It is nice. It is nice.

